ecological, human health
and safety, with a

01:33:07.322 --> 01:33:11.162
relatively small improvement.
So drag reduction on airplanes,

01:33:11.402 --> 01:33:15.082
better artificial hearts, you
know, more efficient wind

01:33:15.142 --> 01:33:19.282
turbines and gas turbines and, you
