01:36:33.342 --> 01:36:37.202
By the time they blow up, it
stops being a fluid. It's like-

01:36:37.242 --> 01:36:38.102
- There's no black holes.

01:36:38.242 --> 01:36:41.122
- There's no black holes. Like
other physics takes over.

01:36:41.282 --> 01:36:44.762
- But it's poss-- Wait, I think it's
