01:46:46.442 --> 01:46:50.342
cascade, which is why hurricanes form.
You actually have little vortices

01:46:50.782 --> 01:46:56.402
coalescing into medium vortices coalescing
into bigger vortices. But so the AI proof

01:46:57.382 --> 01:47:01.062
of this kind of counterexample that
you can have finite blowup basically

01:47:01.142 --> 01:47:04.382
creates this very, very specialized vortex

01:47:05.282 --> 01:47:09.182
that in the third dimension is
stretching out and thinning it

01:47:09.902 --> 01:47:13.742
so that it can essentially become, uh,

01:47:14.602 --> 01:47:18.162
infinitely thin. The radius gets
smaller and smaller and smaller

01:47:18.662 --> 01:47:19.742
as it stretches out,

01:47:20.602 --> 01:47:24.582
Kind of like a figure skater doing
a spin. You pull your arms in,

01:47:24.642 --> 01:47:28.282
you go much, much faster. And there's
this very specialized kind of

01:47:28.502 --> 01:47:32.302
rate of contraction of this vortex so that
the energy in the fluid still remains

01:47:32.362 --> 01:47:36.262
