01:47:45.582 --> 01:47:47.282
be possible to find this counterexample.

01:47:47.562 --> 01:47:49.242
- Which only started maybe 15 years ago.

01:47:49.662 --> 01:47:51.202
- That's right. It's,
like, relatively recent-

01:47:51.202 --> 01:47:52.362
... in the grand scheme of things. Yep.

01:47:52.822 --> 01:47:55.182
- Instead of looking for a solution,
looking for a counterexample, yeah.

01:47:55.222 --> 01:47:58.982
- Yep. 'Cause all of our physical
